			"notes": "## SlothyHub v1.0.5\n\n### Pack browser and community\n- **Star / unstar packs** - community vote counts sync live (Cloudflare Worker)\n- **Featured pack** - pinned at the top of the browser\n- **Upload tags** - PvP, CIT, swords, armor when submitting a pack\n- **My Uploads** - track pending, approved, and denied submissions in the mod\n- **What's New** - shown on first launch after an update\n\n### Texture Builder\n- Fixed hang on \"Scanning active resource packs...\" (background scan, skips when web catalog is ready)\n\n### Discord\n- Live **top 10 pack star leaderboard** - run /setup-leaderboard in a channel (admin)\n\n### Downloads\n| Minecraft | JAR |\n|-----------|-----|\n| 1.21.9 - 1.21.11 | Main + **CIT companion** (both required) |\n| 1.21.8 | All-in-one (CIT built in) |\n| 1.20 - 1.21.1 | Legacy main + **legacy CIT companion** |\n\nPack catalog: https://ilyslothy.github.io/Slothy-s-Tree\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/IlySlothy/Slothy-s-Tree/compare/v1.0.4-mc1.20-1.21.1...v1.0.5-mc1.21.8"
